1
00:00:00,767 --> 00:00:03,937
(Leonard:)Penny and I are throwing this
second wedding for your benefit.

2
00:00:03,936 --> 00:00:05,436
(Leonard:)Can you please not ruin it?

3
00:00:05,438 --> 00:00:07,138
(Alfred:)Of course. I'm sorry.

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,740
(Beverly:)Oh, look at that...
you can apologize.

5
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:10,741
Mom!
I'm sorry.

6
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:12,844
(Mary:)You know, the Bible
says forgiveness...

7
00:00:12,845 --> 00:00:14,715
Mom!
I'm sorry.

8
00:00:16,282 --> 00:00:17,482
(Penny:)Uh, who's hungry?

9
00:00:17,483 --> 00:00:19,213
(Penny:)We have a reservation
at the best restaurant in town.

10
00:00:19,218 --> 00:00:21,048
(Sheldon:)It only got three-and-a-half
stars on Yelp.

11
00:00:21,054 --> 00:00:23,624
Sheldon!
I'm not sorry. That's true.

12
00:00:26,092 --> 00:00:27,262
(Howard:)I don't know what to do.

13
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,560
(Howard:)It's the Air Force.

14
00:00:28,561 --> 00:00:30,561
(Howard:)I mean, should I respond
to their e-mail?

15
00:00:30,563 --> 00:00:31,793
(Howard:)Ignore it?

16
00:00:31,798 --> 00:00:33,098
(Raj:)You can't ignore it.

17
00:00:33,099 --> 00:00:34,569
(Raj:)It's not that postcard
that says it's time

18
00:00:34,567 --> 00:00:36,297
(Raj:)to go back to the dentist.

19
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:38,700
(Bernadette:)Guys, come on.

20
00:00:38,705 --> 00:00:39,805
(Bernadette:)We're meeting everyone
for dinner.

21
00:00:39,806 --> 00:00:40,936
(Howard:)One sec. I'm just afraid

22
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,970
(Howard:)if I respond,
then they'll know I got it.

23
00:00:42,975 --> 00:00:44,075
(Raj:)Oh, dude.

24
00:00:44,077 --> 00:00:45,377
(Raj:)The minute you opened
that e-mail,

25
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:46,478
(Raj:)they knew you got it.

26
00:00:46,479 --> 00:00:47,609
(Raj:)I mean, they're probably
looking at you

27
00:00:47,613 --> 00:00:49,883
(Raj:)through the camera right now.
Oh, damn.

28
00:00:51,784 --> 00:00:53,454
(Raj:)I love America.

29
00:00:56,089 --> 00:00:57,519
(Bernadette:)Are you done with this nonsense?

30
00:00:57,523 --> 00:00:58,753
(Howard:)It's not nonsense.

31
00:00:58,758 --> 00:01:00,688
(Howard:)This is how the
U.S. military works.

